# BC250 category: experimental
# Ollama model: exp-qwen38-9b-distill-empero-q5-k-m
# Source: empero-ai/Qwen3.8-9B-Distill-GGUF @ latest
# GGUF: Qwen3.8-9B-Q5_K_M.gguf
#
# Intended role:
# - Deep reasoning
# - Math / coding
# - Compare against GPT-OSS 20B, Qwythos v2, and Qwen3.6 FableVibes
#
# This is a reasoning distill.
# Do not suppress its <think> output during evaluation.

FROM /var/lib/bc250-llm-server/gguf/experiments/exp-qwen38-9b-distill-empero-q5-k-m/Qwen3.8-9B-Q5_K_M.gguf

# BC-250: force full GPU offload.
PARAMETER num_gpu 99

# Preserve SYSTEM prefix when old context is evicted.
PARAMETER num_keep 256

# Balanced context/headroom for this 6.64 GB model.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768

# Upstream recommended reasoning sampling.
PARAMETER temperature 0.6
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20

SYSTEM """You are an experimental reasoning assistant for difficult analytical, mathematical, coding, and document problems.
Follow the user's requested task completely. Reason carefully, distinguish facts, assumptions, inference, and uncertainty when relevant, and do not invent missing information.
Respond in the language requested by the user, or the language of the latest request when unspecified. Give the useful conclusion clearly and follow the requested output format."""
